R-CM26 R-CM19 R-CM27 R-FL1 R-FL12 R-CM12 (slice 262a, Design Q642, UX2 UX7 UX16; the texts of docs/slices/262-cli-ux-fixes.md 6.2 to 6.6, approved 2026-11-23): `--help`, `-h` and `help` print the general text; `<cmd> --help`, `<cmd> -h` and `help <cmd>` print the text of the command in the long form, on stdout, exit 0, also with `--json` (help is text) and with a flag that the command does not take. A word that is no command: exit 2, the unknown-command text (Q262-7). The only Fx call of each run is args: the help comes before the parse and the first-run prompt.
